   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all,<div><br></div><div>Is there an option that allow me to run Maaslin for some specific taxonomic level? For example, I want to find association at the genus level using the output of Metaphlan2. Do I need to filter my metaphlan file by myself removing all lines in unwanted taxonomic levels, or there is way doing that using Maaslin?</div><div><br></div><div>I really appreciate all your help.</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Francislon Silva</div><div>Ph.D. Student in Bioinformatics</div><div>Universidade Federal de Minas Gerais - Brasil</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
